    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.1",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            102,
            119,
            129,
            133
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "水泥工业 cement industry",
        "bbox": [
            136,
            136,
            366,
            152
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "本标准指从事水泥原料矿山开采、水泥制造、散装水泥转运以及水泥制品生产的工业部门。",
        "bbox": [
            136,
            154,
            840,
            169
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.2",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            102,
            175,
            131,
            188
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "水泥窑 cement kiln",
        "bbox": [
            136,
            191,
            314,
            207
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "水泥熟料煅烧设备，通常包括回转窑和立窑两种形式。",
        "bbox": [
            136,
            209,
            557,
            226
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.3",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            102,
            230,
            131,
            244
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "窑尾余热利用系统 waste heat utilization system of kiln exhaust gas",
        "bbox": [
            136,
            248,
            739,
            264
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "引入水泥窑窑尾废气，利用废气余热进行物料干燥、发电等，并对余热利用后的废气进行净化处理的系统。",
        "bbox": [
            100,
            266,
            895,
            302
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.4",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            102,
            305,
